{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is a survival game that incorporates elements of &quot;Diablo&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this despairing land abandoned by the gods, darkness is gradually devouring the light. Distorted monsters run wild everywhere, and the night has become a forbidden zone for life. Ancient curses and indescribable evil stir beneath the earth, and only a handful of survivors dare to resist the shackles of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your battlefield and your destiny. Warrior, how will you write your own chapter?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/3d2859e746f12d9b2fcd87350a28d7ef.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/3d2859e746f12d9b2fcd87350a28d7ef.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the powerful warrior to the mysterious warlock, from the necromancer who controls the undead to the agile hunter like a shadow, each class has a unique skill tree and growth path. Choose the class that suits you best according to your playing style and unlock higher - order combat potential, making your legend distinct.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/6bc2b88bc67624b2b09feaf1a9fffdba.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/6bc2b88bc67624b2b09feaf1a9fffdba.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing the oncoming tidal waves of monsters, there is no chance to catch your breath! Every battle is full of challenges - from ordinary enemies to powerful elites, and then to the earth - shattering bosses. Each opponent will test your operation, strategy, and on - the - spot reaction. Only the toughest warriors can survive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/cd53e9bb2240a6f996d7d497a38c3884.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/cd53e9bb2240a6f996d7d497a38c3884.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot;, the most dangerous thing is not the wandering monsters, but the darkness after nightfall. The darkness will gradually consume your sanity, and the distorted monsters lurking in the dark will gradually reveal themselves and show their fangs. No matter how brave the survivors are, they can't survive in the darkness after losing their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting a torch will be the only way for you to survive!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/a140c1f47078ac1057a12ab5af0361dd.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/a140c1f47078ac1057a12ab5af0361dd.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the core features of &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is its extremely high degree of freedom. In addition to the exclusive talent tree for each class, you can use any weapon and starting skills. A large number of unique skills and skill expansion effects allow you to have a different combat experience in each game. Similar to the skill runes in &quot;Path of Exile&quot;, they can be freely inlaid on skills to change their effects, making the richness and combination of builds an endless possibility.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/f7d95c422355fb80a73c058b582045e1.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/f7d95c422355fb80a73c058b582045e1.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cursed land hides countless secrets: forgotten ancient ruins, dangerous underground labyrinths, and mysterious documents scattered everywhere. Every exploration may uncover the truth of a lost civilization, but it may also come at an irreparable cost. Only the brave can pierce the fog and discover the hidden truth.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/d2743096bdc5493007230cfaaa097695.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/d2743096bdc5493007230cfaaa097695.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; has a truly &quot;Diablo&quot; - like equipment system. Loot is randomly generated, with ever - changing attributes. You can obtain it from monsters, bosses, or merchants, and you can even use the gambling function to get some powerful equipment. There are also hundreds of powerful legendary items waiting for you to discover in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is coming soon to Steam. Warrior, can you light the hope in this darkness and become the hero of &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot;? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, and let's tear through the darkness and welcome the dawn together!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"triumphant return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/8c1125086ff36db3b26119675601ac5e0db444fa.jpg"},{"name":"Special Move","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/89f1f3e62f1337581df6aa3e854d7603a04ac511.jpg"},{"name":"Exquisite technique","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/74b18c2bdafee4825efe3e3b14e9ba3bdc658b04.jpg"},{"name":"Arcane Peak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/d4ab09989de4a28b3525c113f1301e0d1d960689.jpg"},{"name":"The legendary strongman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/c538947d708d618b0fe441076159f25b8f305bc7.jpg"},{"name":"Well-informed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/e336ee7418e02a905acef9dd2e3ae9e726fa4296.jpg"},{"name":"Step by step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/8f6d4d96fd12b37a60173f9a555365474fd2230a.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Critical Hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/cca69bfa2b525f829277ed97cde7ab85c3df187f.jpg"},{"name":"Steady and cautious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/877dbb7d3bdb9e17ff19d399c5a83ca9bbdb7102.jpg"},{"name":"Hunting Team","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3419290/147ec3690df14a0644400483763bfade27057219.jpg"}],"total":89},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419290?t=1770361739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770361739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/dbb18b0ff528d60e6e6bee532a167569cbe62b96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770361739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/dbb18b0ff528d60e6e6bee532a167569cbe62b96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770361739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3476690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/0a8ab6525e92bb34b98b4ed5bcd54127.avif?t=1770361739\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is a survival game that incorporates elements of &quot;Diablo&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this despairing land abandoned by the gods, darkness is gradually devouring the light. Distorted monsters run wild everywhere, and the night has become a forbidden zone for life. Ancient curses and indescribable evil stir beneath the earth, and only a handful of survivors dare to resist the shackles of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your battlefield and your destiny. Warrior, how will you write your own chapter?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/3d2859e746f12d9b2fcd87350a28d7ef.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/3d2859e746f12d9b2fcd87350a28d7ef.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the powerful warrior to the mysterious warlock, from the necromancer who controls the undead to the agile hunter like a shadow, each class has a unique skill tree and growth path. Choose the class that suits you best according to your playing style and unlock higher - order combat potential, making your legend distinct.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/1984ab0237c3189a53d5cba25e5d9a2c.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/6bc2b88bc67624b2b09feaf1a9fffdba.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/6bc2b88bc67624b2b09feaf1a9fffdba.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing the oncoming tidal waves of monsters, there is no chance to catch your breath! Every battle is full of challenges - from ordinary enemies to powerful elites, and then to the earth - shattering bosses. Each opponent will test your operation, strategy, and on - the - spot reaction. Only the toughest warriors can survive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/08e7a3af55c9b0a7e00343d1c3c7b806.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/cd53e9bb2240a6f996d7d497a38c3884.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/cd53e9bb2240a6f996d7d497a38c3884.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot;, the most dangerous thing is not the wandering monsters, but the darkness after nightfall. The darkness will gradually consume your sanity, and the distorted monsters lurking in the dark will gradually reveal themselves and show their fangs. No matter how brave the survivors are, they can't survive in the darkness after losing their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting a torch will be the only way for you to survive!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/ce979ca6295dafdd0470651ca009dc2b.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/a140c1f47078ac1057a12ab5af0361dd.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/a140c1f47078ac1057a12ab5af0361dd.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the core features of &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is its extremely high degree of freedom. In addition to the exclusive talent tree for each class, you can use any weapon and starting skills. A large number of unique skills and skill expansion effects allow you to have a different combat experience in each game. Similar to the skill runes in &quot;Path of Exile&quot;, they can be freely inlaid on skills to change their effects, making the richness and combination of builds an endless possibility.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/97bdf1665ebec3dbe9bca2c6e8f2bc09.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/f7d95c422355fb80a73c058b582045e1.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/f7d95c422355fb80a73c058b582045e1.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cursed land hides countless secrets: forgotten ancient ruins, dangerous underground labyrinths, and mysterious documents scattered everywhere. Every exploration may uncover the truth of a lost civilization, but it may also come at an irreparable cost. Only the brave can pierce the fog and discover the hidden truth.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/2f784ce42727e822080136d3a6327cd1.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/d2743096bdc5493007230cfaaa097695.avif?t=1770361739\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras_big/d2743096bdc5493007230cfaaa097695.avif?t=1770361739 width=800 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; has a truly &quot;Diablo&quot; - like equipment system. Loot is randomly generated, with ever - changing attributes. You can obtain it from monsters, bosses, or merchants, and you can even use the gambling function to get some powerful equipment. There are also hundreds of powerful legendary items waiting for you to discover in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.poster.avif?t=1770361739\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.webm?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/extras/5ded2b1a65af560d8ce846b82c7f5848.mp4?t=1770361739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot; is coming soon to Steam. Warrior, can you light the hope in this darkness and become the hero of &quot;The Land Forsaken by Gods&quot;? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, and let's tear through the darkness and welcome the dawn together!</p>","developers":["insight studio"],"dlc":[3985080,4340460],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419290/header.jpg?t=1770361739","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419290/816897/8bb970e8a82f780978660c5e6538b775acd777ac/1750849127/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740040906","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419290/816897/8bb970e8a82f780978660c5e6538b775acd777ac/1750849127/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740040906","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419290/816897/8bb970e8a82f780978660c5e6538b775acd777ac/1750849127/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740040906","id":257091317,"name":"PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091317/98e4885f4e48637619f0837b5901081fa1258d2a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740040906"}],"name":"GOD FORSAKEN","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"GOD FORSAKEN - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$13.99</span> $9.79 USD","packageid":1209266,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":979}],"title":"Buy GOD FORSAKEN"}],"packages":[120